WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.468 --> 00:00:04.003
-With a few exceptions,
Republicans have made clear

00:00:04.003 --> 00:00:06.005
that they're willing
to excuse the behavior

00:00:06.005 --> 00:00:07.940
of both former president
Donald Trump

00:00:07.940 --> 00:00:10.409
and Georgia Congresswoman
Marjorie Taylor Greene.

00:00:10.409 --> 00:00:12.712
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:16.582 --> 00:00:19.685
Until now, it's been very clear
to me that Donald Trump

00:00:19.685 --> 00:00:22.021
should face every legal
consequence imaginable

00:00:22.021 --> 00:00:24.156
for trying to overthrow
the United States government.

00:00:24.156 --> 00:00:26.059
He should be impeached,
convicted,

00:00:26.059 --> 00:00:28.361
and barred from ever
holding office again.

00:00:28.361 --> 00:00:29.862
His properties should be seized.

00:00:29.862 --> 00:00:31.430
His golf courses
should be turned

00:00:31.430 --> 00:00:33.332
into publicly protected
wetlands,

00:00:33.332 --> 00:00:36.002
and his namesake son should be
banished to the woods

00:00:36.002 --> 00:00:39.205
to live among the only creatures
who truly understand him,

00:00:39.205 --> 00:00:40.206
the stumps.

00:00:40.206 --> 00:00:42.908
King of the stumps!

00:00:42.908 --> 00:00:45.945
But then Republican Senator
Lindsey Graham made a threat

00:00:45.945 --> 00:00:49.648
so chilling, so harrowing,
I had to reconsider my position.

00:00:49.648 --> 00:00:53.319
If Democrats choose to move
forward and call witnesses,

00:00:53.319 --> 00:00:57.523
Graham said he'd have no choice
but to do something unthinkable,

00:00:57.523 --> 00:00:59.892
investigate what happened.

00:00:59.892 --> 00:01:03.729
-To my Democratic colleagues, if
you vote to call one witness --

00:01:03.729 --> 00:01:06.966
none were called in the House --
get ready for a long trial.

00:01:06.966 --> 00:01:08.701
If you open up
that can of worms,

00:01:08.701 --> 00:01:11.504
we'll want the FBI to come in
and tell us about

00:01:11.504 --> 00:01:14.541
how people actually preplanned
these attacks

00:01:14.541 --> 00:01:16.976
and what happened
with the security footprint

00:01:16.976 --> 00:01:18.144
at the Capitol.

00:01:18.144 --> 00:01:20.880
You open up Pandora's box
if you call one witness.

00:01:20.880 --> 00:01:23.849
-Yeah, because, famously,
when Pandora opened her box,

00:01:23.849 --> 00:01:26.652
that's what came out --
useful information.

00:01:26.652 --> 00:01:27.986
You hear him, Democrats?

00:01:27.986 --> 00:01:29.722
Lindsey Graham is threatening
to make your life hell

00:01:29.722 --> 00:01:31.291
by finding out
exactly what happened

00:01:31.291 --> 00:01:33.726
and then making
those things public.

00:01:33.726 --> 00:01:35.427
Ooh, you're not gonna like that,
Democrats.

00:01:35.427 --> 00:01:36.429
Public accountability

00:01:36.429 --> 00:01:37.830
for Donald Trump
and his accomplices?

00:01:37.830 --> 00:01:40.833
I mean, what's next, witnesses,
evidence, consequences?

00:01:40.833 --> 00:01:42.302
[ As Lindsey Graham ] You better
be careful, Democrats,

00:01:42.302 --> 00:01:44.270
or I'll have no choice
but to get to the bottom

00:01:44.270 --> 00:01:46.905
of what Donald Trump did and,
if necessary, convict him.

00:01:46.905 --> 00:01:48.308
Is that what you want?

00:01:48.308 --> 00:01:51.043
Donald Trump shuffling off
to prison in leg irons

00:01:51.043 --> 00:01:52.078
never to be seen again?

00:01:52.078 --> 00:01:54.313
Oh, you'll rue the day,
Democrats.

00:01:54.313 --> 00:01:55.882
What's that, Meemaw?

00:01:55.882 --> 00:01:57.116
I'm making a fool of myself?

00:01:57.116 --> 00:01:59.485
The only fool here is you,
Meemaw!

00:01:59.485 --> 00:02:02.555
I heard you got caught
shoplifting at the A&amp;P again.

00:02:02.555 --> 00:02:04.056
Meemaw!

00:02:04.056 --> 00:02:06.392
Why don't you close
that dang music box

00:02:06.392 --> 00:02:10.463
and quit smearing your lipstick
with your thumb?

00:02:10.463 --> 00:02:12.532
[ Normal voice ] It's so
mind-boggling and bewildering

00:02:12.532 --> 00:02:15.401
that Graham thinks proving
the attack was preplanned

00:02:15.401 --> 00:02:17.503
somehow gets Trump off the hook.

00:02:17.503 --> 00:02:19.872
It's like getting caught
standing over a dead body

00:02:19.872 --> 00:02:21.674
holding a knife, saying,
"Officer, you don't understand.

00:02:21.674 --> 00:02:23.609
I've had this knife for years."

00:02:23.609 --> 00:02:26.078
It would actually be very useful
to have an in-depth trial

00:02:26.078 --> 00:02:28.348
where every aspect of the
insurrection is investigated

00:02:28.348 --> 00:02:29.515
in full view of the public,

00:02:29.515 --> 00:02:31.117
because every day we learn more

00:02:31.117 --> 00:02:32.518
about the events
leading up to it,

00:02:32.518 --> 00:02:35.354
including details of Trump's
concerted months-long effort

00:02:35.354 --> 00:02:37.223
to get the results
of the election overturned.

00:02:37.223 --> 00:02:39.325
This week, Axios reported
stunning new details

00:02:39.325 --> 00:02:40.526
about what they call

00:02:40.526 --> 00:02:42.562
"the craziest meeting
of the Trump presidency,"

00:02:42.562 --> 00:02:45.765
which is saying a lot given
he's also met with Ted Nugent,

00:02:45.765 --> 00:02:49.434
Sarah Palin, Kanye West,
and a can of uncooked beans.

00:02:49.434 --> 00:02:51.003
[ As Donald Trump ]
Do you know anything about
voter fraud, beans?

00:02:51.003 --> 00:02:52.371
[ High-pitched voice ] Sí.

00:02:52.371 --> 00:02:53.539
[ As Donald Trump ] You do?
[ High-pitched voice ] Sí.

00:02:53.539 --> 00:02:54.907
[ Donald Trump ] What about you,
adobo seasonings?

00:02:54.907 --> 00:02:56.109
[ Deep voice ] Alright.

00:02:57.877 --> 00:03:00.279
[ Normal voice ]
Trump met with a group of
unhinged conspiracy theorists,

00:03:00.279 --> 00:03:02.147
including Michael Flynn,
who has called for Trump

00:03:02.147 --> 00:03:03.883
to use the military
to seize voting machines

00:03:03.883 --> 00:03:05.251
and rerun the election,

00:03:05.251 --> 00:03:07.987
effectively installing himself
as a military dictator,

00:03:07.987 --> 00:03:10.489
and Sidney Powell,
the lawyer who faces

00:03:10.489 --> 00:03:14.727
$1.3 billion defamation suit for
claiming the election was rigged

00:03:14.727 --> 00:03:16.962
as part of an international
Communist plot,

00:03:16.962 --> 00:03:19.565
including the late Venezuelan
president Hugo Chávez,

00:03:19.565 --> 00:03:22.201
and who always looks
like she just got done

00:03:22.201 --> 00:03:24.704
taking a sledgehammer
to James Caan's legs.

00:03:24.704 --> 00:03:27.106
At one point during
this meeting, Powell...

00:03:35.648 --> 00:03:36.983
A White House aide replied...

00:03:46.792 --> 00:03:48.061
Powell replied...

00:03:52.664 --> 00:03:54.967
[ Scoffs ]
You know you're far gone

00:03:54.967 --> 00:03:57.770
when even Rudy hasn't caught up
to your insanity yet.

00:03:57.770 --> 00:03:59.805
It's like being too abstract
for Picasso.

00:03:59.805 --> 00:04:03.309
"Dalí, I'm all for having fun,
but clocks don't melt, my man."

00:04:03.309 --> 00:04:05.911
Although the idea
that Rudy doesn't know

00:04:05.911 --> 00:04:08.214
what the case is about
would not surprise me.

00:04:08.214 --> 00:04:10.149
I'm sure walking Rudy
through a case

00:04:10.149 --> 00:04:12.652
is like watching "Inception"
with your grandpa.

00:04:12.652 --> 00:04:15.454
"A dream within a dream?
Okay, fancy pants.

00:04:15.454 --> 00:04:18.390
Wake me up when the Allies
start bombing the Nazis.

00:04:18.390 --> 00:04:19.859
That's my kind of movie."

00:04:19.859 --> 00:04:21.494
So that's how this insane
this meeting was --

00:04:21.494 --> 00:04:24.597
too insane for Rudy Giuliani.

00:04:24.597 --> 00:04:27.866
A third insane person in
the meeting was Patrick Byrne,

00:04:27.866 --> 00:04:31.737
the former CEO of overstock.com,
because why not?

00:04:31.737 --> 00:04:33.740
They got MyPillow, Overstock.

00:04:33.740 --> 00:04:37.009
All they need now to complete
the roster of business all-stars

00:04:37.009 --> 00:04:38.744
is the CFO of Hollywood Video

00:04:38.744 --> 00:04:41.780
and an actively on-fire
Samsung Galaxy.

00:04:41.780 --> 00:04:44.350
Now, all you need to know
for this next part

00:04:44.350 --> 00:04:47.119
is that Byrne got into
a heated confrontation

00:04:47.119 --> 00:04:49.288
with a White House official
named Eric Herschmann.

00:04:49.288 --> 00:04:51.690
The White House Counsel,
Pat Cipollone,

00:04:51.690 --> 00:04:53.059
was also in the room.

00:05:24.123 --> 00:05:25.925
The best and the brightest,
folks.

00:05:25.925 --> 00:05:28.027
These guys want everyone
to have voter I.D.

00:05:28.027 --> 00:05:29.094
But they don't even
know the I.D.

00:05:29.094 --> 00:05:30.329
of the person
they're talking to.

00:05:30.329 --> 00:05:31.730
I can't believe I'm saying this,

00:05:31.730 --> 00:05:34.466
but if Rudy had been there
for that part of the meeting,

00:05:34.466 --> 00:05:37.970
his presence would have actually
raised the average IQ level.

00:05:37.970 --> 00:05:40.272
Though he would have
probably also yelled,

00:05:40.272 --> 00:05:41.407
"Do you know who I am?"

00:05:41.407 --> 00:05:43.776
and sincerely
meant the question.

00:05:43.776 --> 00:05:45.044
[ As Rudy Giuliani ]
Do you know who I am?

00:05:45.044 --> 00:05:46.979
Do you know where I am
in the month, please?

00:05:46.979 --> 00:05:48.514
I keep my name
stitched in my suit,

00:05:48.514 --> 00:05:50.917
but this is a loner jacket
from Del Frisco's!

00:05:50.917 --> 00:05:54.053
Now I know how Scrooge felt --
confused!

00:05:57.990 --> 00:06:00.226
I'm not Hugo Boss, am I?

00:06:02.294 --> 00:06:03.829
[ Normal voice ] Trump is gone,
but that doesn't mean

00:06:03.829 --> 00:06:06.031
we can just forget about
the crimes he committed,

00:06:06.031 --> 00:06:08.367
the calamities he unleashed,
and the forces he exposed

00:06:08.367 --> 00:06:10.569
because those forces
are at the very heart

00:06:10.569 --> 00:06:12.805
of the modern Republican Party
and will be going forward,

00:06:12.805 --> 00:06:15.607
as evidenced by Congresswoman
Marjorie Taylor Greene.

00:06:15.607 --> 00:06:17.276
Greene has, among other things,

00:06:17.276 --> 00:06:19.411
claimed school shootings
were staged,

00:06:19.411 --> 00:06:22.215
suggested that Nancy Pelosi
should be executed for treason,

00:06:22.215 --> 00:06:24.317
and said Muslims shouldn't serve
in government,

00:06:24.317 --> 00:06:27.086
and yet GOP leaders in the House
have refused to sanction her,

00:06:27.086 --> 00:06:29.555
forcing Democrats to move
forward with the resolution

00:06:29.555 --> 00:06:31.023
revoking her
committee assignments.

00:06:31.023 --> 00:06:33.392
Others have brushed
the controversy aside.

00:06:33.392 --> 00:06:34.761
For example, Lindsey Graham...

00:06:54.313 --> 00:06:55.815
Oh, sure, take her word for it.

00:06:55.815 --> 00:06:57.683
[ As Lindsey Graham ]
Congresswoman Greene assured me

00:06:57.683 --> 00:07:00.887
that while the posts were
on her Facebook page,

00:07:00.887 --> 00:07:03.723
it's only because Bill Gates
gave her password

00:07:03.723 --> 00:07:06.725
to the ghost of Hugo Chávez,
and that's good enough for me.

00:07:06.725 --> 00:07:09.361
Meemaw, are you satisfied?

00:07:09.361 --> 00:07:11.430
Meemaw, I will help you
with your corset,

00:07:11.430 --> 00:07:14.467
but I'm telling you, there is
no colonel coming over tonight!

00:07:14.467 --> 00:07:17.102
Meemaw, that was a movie
we watched!

00:07:17.102 --> 00:07:20.973
Not that one, Peepaw.
That was "Inception."

00:07:20.973 --> 00:07:22.475
You two!

00:07:24.810 --> 00:07:26.345
[ Normal voice ]
But the dumbest excuse

00:07:26.345 --> 00:07:27.679
for refusing to condemn Greene

00:07:27.679 --> 00:07:30.616
came from newly minted Alabama
senator Tommy Tuberville,

00:07:30.616 --> 00:07:32.452
who is apparently
as dumb as his name.

00:07:32.452 --> 00:07:34.420
Sounds like a cartoon jar
of mayonnaise

00:07:34.420 --> 00:07:36.956
who tries to kidnap
the Veggie Tales.

00:07:36.956 --> 00:07:40.459
Tuberville told CNN he hadn't
seen Greene's posts because,

00:07:40.459 --> 00:07:44.230
and this is real, a real excuse,
the weather's been bad.

00:07:53.639 --> 00:07:54.907
Look, I really
don't want to repeat

00:07:54.907 --> 00:07:56.576
any negative stereotypes
about the South,

00:07:56.576 --> 00:07:59.679
but you're not doing Alabama
any favors when, as a senator,

00:07:59.679 --> 00:08:02.381
you claim you can't watch the
news because of the weather.

00:08:02.381 --> 00:08:04.416
Do you still are have
rabbit ears on your TV?

00:08:04.416 --> 00:08:06.151
[ Southern accent ] I haven't
looked at what she's done

00:08:06.151 --> 00:08:08.820
because the gossipy polecat
who tells me the news

00:08:08.820 --> 00:08:10.122
has been hibernating.

00:08:10.122 --> 00:08:11.691
[ Normal voice ] Also,
I love when these dopes

00:08:11.691 --> 00:08:13.926
can't even get to the finish
line on their own bull[bleep]

00:08:13.926 --> 00:08:16.562
and then just give up at the end
and say "whatever."

00:08:16.562 --> 00:08:18.263
[ Southern accent ]
I meant to look at my phone,

00:08:18.263 --> 00:08:20.633
but the battery was dead.

00:08:20.633 --> 00:08:22.701
Or I dropped it in the toilet.

00:08:22.701 --> 00:08:25.170
Or [Stammering] whatever.

00:08:25.170 --> 00:08:27.806
[ Normal voice ]
But I have to say, the most vile
defense of Greene I saw today

00:08:27.806 --> 00:08:29.542
came from Republicans
on Fox News,

00:08:29.542 --> 00:08:30.943
which repeatedly
tried to equate her

00:08:30.943 --> 00:08:33.012
with Minnesota congresswoman
Ilhan Omar,

00:08:33.012 --> 00:08:35.147
including this comment
from Bill Hemmer.

00:08:35.147 --> 00:08:38.184
-What she's doing is of a whole
different kettle of fish.

00:08:38.184 --> 00:08:40.853
-One might be weird and kooky,
Josh.

00:08:40.853 --> 00:08:42.688
The other is seen as racist.

00:08:42.688 --> 00:08:44.590
-Hmm, let's see,
one wants Medicare for all

00:08:44.590 --> 00:08:49.161
and the other thinks a Jewish
space laser starts wildfires.

00:08:49.161 --> 00:08:50.396
Seriously,
what's wrong with you?

00:08:50.396 --> 00:08:51.730
There's no equivalence,

00:08:51.730 --> 00:08:53.766
and any attempt to create one
is disgusting and racist.

00:08:53.766 --> 00:08:55.667
Greene has refused to apologize,

00:08:55.667 --> 00:08:57.937
despite sharing anti-Muslim
and anti-Semitic posts

00:08:57.937 --> 00:08:59.071
questioning whether a plane

00:08:59.071 --> 00:09:00.973
really crashed into the Pentagon
on 9/11,

00:09:00.973 --> 00:09:02.808
suggesting that school shootings
were fake,

00:09:02.808 --> 00:09:04.309
that Nancy Pelosi
should be executed,

00:09:04.309 --> 00:09:05.711
that Barack Obama
is a secret Muslim,

00:09:05.711 --> 00:09:06.778
that Muslims
shouldn't be allowed

00:09:06.778 --> 00:09:08.247
to serve at all
in the government,

00:09:08.247 --> 00:09:12.852
and, once again, that a Jewish
space laser starts wildfires.

00:09:12.852 --> 00:09:14.252
That's way beyond
weird and kooky.

00:09:14.252 --> 00:09:15.788
She's not a member
of the Addams Family,

00:09:15.788 --> 00:09:17.590
unless Uncle Fester believed

00:09:17.590 --> 00:09:22.127
that a Jewish space laser
starts wildfires.

00:09:22.127 --> 00:09:25.197
It's not your crunchy aunt
who's into Reiki and crystals

00:09:25.197 --> 00:09:27.633
and sews birds
onto all her sweaters.

00:09:27.633 --> 00:09:29.535
"Before we sit down
for Thanksgiving dinner,

00:09:29.535 --> 00:09:33.138
allow me to sage the room
and cleanse our auras, namaste."

00:09:33.138 --> 00:09:34.874
"Connie, your boob is out.

00:09:34.874 --> 00:09:38.877
Aunt Connie, your boob,
it's in the casserole."

00:09:38.877 --> 00:09:40.913
This is the bad-faith
bull[bleep]

00:09:40.913 --> 00:09:42.247
that right-wing media
is full off

00:09:42.247 --> 00:09:43.349
because they have nothing else.

00:09:43.349 --> 00:09:45.584
It's a movement
that is fully radicalized

00:09:45.584 --> 00:09:48.253
against pluralistic,
multiracial democracy,

00:09:48.253 --> 00:09:50.723
and now the right-wing media's
cannibalizing itself

00:09:50.723 --> 00:09:53.492
as they compete to appeal
to the far-right fringe.

00:09:53.492 --> 00:09:54.693
There's no better example
of that

00:09:54.693 --> 00:09:56.061
than what happened on Newsmax,

00:09:56.061 --> 00:09:59.231
which has tried to outflank
Fox News on the far right.

00:09:59.231 --> 00:10:01.066
They invited on
the MyPillow guy,

00:10:01.066 --> 00:10:02.568
who, you might remember,

00:10:02.568 --> 00:10:04.836
has also claimed the election
was hacked by China

00:10:04.836 --> 00:10:07.305
and walked into the Oval Office
for a meeting with Trump

00:10:07.305 --> 00:10:09.942
holding notes that said
"martial law" on them.

00:10:09.942 --> 00:10:12.077
Newsmax was just trying
to get Lindell

00:10:12.077 --> 00:10:14.346
to complain
about cancel culture,

00:10:14.346 --> 00:10:18.384
not repeat his election fraud
lies, but then this happened.

00:10:18.384 --> 00:10:22.755
-What happened with your Twitter
account and the company page?

00:10:22.755 --> 00:10:25.057
-Well, first mine was taken down

00:10:25.057 --> 00:10:27.059
because we have
all the election fraud

00:10:27.059 --> 00:10:28.293
with these Dominion machines.

00:10:28.293 --> 00:10:29.995
We have 100% proof.

00:10:29.995 --> 00:10:32.465
And then when they
took it down...

00:10:32.465 --> 00:10:33.899
-Mike. Mike.

00:10:33.899 --> 00:10:37.303
-And then I put it back up,
my personal, I put a --

00:10:37.303 --> 00:10:39.038
-Mike, thank you very much.

00:10:39.038 --> 00:10:43.509
Mike, Mike, you're talking
about machines that --

00:10:43.509 --> 00:10:45.911
We at Newsmax
have not been able to verify

00:10:45.911 --> 00:10:48.947
any of those kinds
of allegations.

00:10:48.947 --> 00:10:53.219
We wanted to talk to you about
canceling culture, if you will.

00:10:53.219 --> 00:10:55.487
We don't want to relitigate

00:10:55.487 --> 00:10:58.290
the allegations
that you're making, Mike.

00:10:58.290 --> 00:11:00.192
Could you make an argument
that this could be

00:11:00.192 --> 00:11:03.562
a temporary banning
rather than permanent?

00:11:03.562 --> 00:11:07.066
-No, I want it to be a permanent
because you know what?

00:11:07.066 --> 00:11:09.768
They did this because I'm
revealing all the evidence

00:11:09.768 --> 00:11:13.506
on Friday of all of the election
fraud with these machines.

00:11:13.506 --> 00:11:16.342
So I'm sorry if you think
it's not, but it's real.

00:11:16.342 --> 00:11:20.579
-Can I ask our producers,
can we get out of here, please?

00:11:20.579 --> 00:11:22.614
I don't want to have to
keep going over this.

00:11:22.614 --> 00:11:24.716
-We at Newsmax have not
been able to verify

00:11:24.716 --> 00:11:26.619
any of those allegations
that you're --

00:11:26.619 --> 00:11:29.254
-Mike, hold on a second.
Everybody hold on a second.

00:11:29.254 --> 00:11:31.156
Mike, Mike, hold on one second.

00:11:31.156 --> 00:11:33.092
Let's talk a little bit --

00:11:33.092 --> 00:11:36.896
-Oh...my...pillow.

00:11:36.896 --> 00:11:39.965
Usually you see the guests
storm off but never the anchor.

00:11:39.965 --> 00:11:41.433
Where do you even go after that?

00:11:41.433 --> 00:11:44.536
That's like trying to storm out
of a meeting in your own office.

00:11:44.536 --> 00:11:47.773
"This is bull[bleep]
And I hate this job and I quit!

00:11:49.775 --> 00:11:51.310
Could you guys
maybe take this meeting

00:11:51.310 --> 00:11:52.578
down to the conference room?"

00:11:52.578 --> 00:11:54.813
Also, I got to ask,
does MyPillow actually work?

00:11:54.813 --> 00:11:58.083
Because this guy looks like
he hasn't slept in a year.

00:11:58.083 --> 00:12:00.585
Is MyPillow
just a bag full of rats?

00:12:00.585 --> 00:12:01.887
You need to sleep, Mike.

00:12:01.887 --> 00:12:04.356
"Who can sleep with all that
infernal scratching!"

00:12:04.356 --> 00:12:07.726
He always looks like he was
just chased by Da Bears!

00:12:07.726 --> 00:12:09.295
[ Laughter ]

00:12:12.364 --> 00:12:14.433
Also, this segment
is so revealing,

00:12:14.433 --> 00:12:17.903
because instead of focusing
on the actual content

00:12:17.903 --> 00:12:20.272
of what Lindell is supposedly
being canceled for,

00:12:20.272 --> 00:12:23.208
they just want him to say
the words "cancel culture,"

00:12:23.208 --> 00:12:24.243
and he won't go along.

00:12:24.243 --> 00:12:25.644
It shows how empty

00:12:25.644 --> 00:12:27.679
their cancel-culture
talking points are.

00:12:27.679 --> 00:12:30.015
They complain that free speech
is being suppressed,

00:12:30.015 --> 00:12:32.551
and then once he starts saying
something they don't like,

00:12:32.551 --> 00:12:34.086
they try to suppress his speech.

00:12:34.086 --> 00:12:36.989
It's like taking your toddler
to an adult dinner party

00:12:36.989 --> 00:12:39.591
and saying to him, "Hey,
remember, you say thank you,

00:12:39.591 --> 00:12:41.527
you say please,
and that's it, okay?"

00:12:41.527 --> 00:12:44.196
And then the second you walk in
the door, he immediately shouts,

00:12:44.196 --> 00:12:47.733
"Mommy caught Daddy following
the babysitter on Instagram!"

00:12:47.733 --> 00:12:50.469
We are facing multiple
simultaneous crises

00:12:50.469 --> 00:12:51.837
that have created
misery and suffering

00:12:51.837 --> 00:12:54.339
for millions of Americans
with a botched vaccine rollout,

00:12:54.339 --> 00:12:57.076
an economic crash, and poverty
and child hunger on the rise.

00:12:57.076 --> 00:12:59.912
We need a political system
that can respond urgently

00:12:59.912 --> 00:13:01.013
to those crises.

00:13:01.013 --> 00:13:02.347
Instead we have
one political party

00:13:02.347 --> 00:13:03.882
radicalizing against democracy,

00:13:03.882 --> 00:13:05.617
siding with seditionists
and bigots.

00:13:05.617 --> 00:13:06.751
It's almost as if,

00:13:06.751 --> 00:13:09.154
in a desperate bid for power
at any cost,

00:13:09.154 --> 00:13:10.556
the GOP was willing to...

00:13:10.556 --> 00:13:12.357
-Open up Pandora's box.

00:13:12.357 --> 00:13:14.193
-This has been "A Closer Look."

00:13:17.395 --> 00:13:19.265
God's Love We Deliver
cooks and brings

00:13:19.265 --> 00:13:20.699
over 2 million meals a year

00:13:20.699 --> 00:13:23.302
to men, women, and children
living with HIV/AIDS, cancer,

00:13:23.302 --> 00:13:24.603
and other serious illnesses,

00:13:24.603 --> 00:13:26.638
and they need your help
now more than ever.

00:13:26.638 --> 00:13:28.974
If you're watching this online,
you can hit the "donate" button.

00:13:28.974 --> 00:13:32.077
Stay safe. Wash your hands.
Wear a mask. We love you.

